18:44:48.813577 [debug]: create_debug_span(...).entered() took 17.299µs
18:44:48.825968 [debug]: stmt.execute() (submit+wait_for_completion, returns reader) took 10.412002ms
18:44:48.826014 [debug]: reader.schema() took 652ns
18:44:48.826092 [debug]: do_execute(conn) (closure: stmt.execute + schema + batch loop) took 12.478129ms
