19:23:04.123936 [debug]: create_debug_span(...).entered() took 30.309µs
19:23:04.136600 [debug]: stmt.execute() (submit+wait_for_completion, returns reader) took 8.594385ms
19:23:04.136866 [debug]: reader.schema() took 1.797µs
19:23:04.137133 [debug]: do_execute(conn) (closure: stmt.execute + schema + batch loop) took 13.106505ms
19:23:04.137215 [debug]: concat_batches + normalize_result_column_names took 13.515µs
